      "content": "it’s not that simple though. it feels like i burned the whole house down. they didn't just sacrifice for a scholarship, they sacrificed for the version of me that actually makes them proud. now that i've failed, i'm just a walking reminder of everything they lost. i feel like i'm just dragging them down, making them live with this version of me that's just... broken. it would be so much easier for them to just remember me as the kid who had everything going for them, instead of having to watch me struggle like this every single day.",
